==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|molar|ity}} in the chemistry usage.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|æɹɪti}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chemistry}} the [[concentration]] of a [[substance]] in [[solution]], expressed as the [[number]] [[mole]]s of [[solute]] per [[litre]] of [[solution]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|molar concentration}}

====Related terms====
